**what_they_want_from_this_post:** A fast, confident answer to "which Christmas color will actually look good on ME" — not a countdown of 12 pretty polishes to scroll through, and not a generic undertone lecture. She wants her specific skin tone (or the closest match) named and matched.

**what_frustrates_them:** Existing content is split into two frustrating camps — general "nail colors for your skin tone" guides that never mention Christmas at all, or Christmas roundups that mention skin tone once in a subheading and then ignore it for the rest of the article. Dark-skin content and fair-skin content rarely sit in the same piece, forcing the reader to piece together an answer from multiple sources.

