4. Unsure if gold or silver metallics suit her — assumes this is purely aesthetic when it's actually undertone-driven
5. Wants reassurance that darker or deeper skin tones aren't an afterthought — validated directly by Essence and multiple Pinterest boards specifically searching "Christmas nails dark skin" / "brown skin"

